{
  "uid": "skp-runtime",
  "title": "SKP Runtime Instrumentation",
  "description": "Runtime instrumentation across all four SKP service classes (webapi / orchestrator / keeper / processor). Metrics come from the process_runtime_dotnet_* family emitted by OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.Runtime 1.15.0 on net8.0 (research F-1). A future net9.0 upgrade would rename the whole family to dotnet_* and blank every panel here; scripts/phase-87-dashboard-lint.ps1 rule S8 hard-fails on any dotnet_* reference so that regression surfaces hermetically in ~5s instead of as a silently empty dashboard.",
  "tags": ["skp", "runtime"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "source",
        "label": "Service class",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total, source)",
        "definition": "label_values(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total, source)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": null,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "pod",
        "label": "Pod",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total{source=~\"$source\"}, service_instance_id)",
        "definition": "label_values(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total{source=~\"$source\"}, service_instance_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": null,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC collections / sec by generation",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id, generation) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}} / {{generation}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC heap size by generation",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id, generation) (process_runtime_dotnet_gc_heap_size_bytes{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}} / {{generation}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC heap fragmentation by generation",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id, generation) (process_runtime_dotnet_gc_heap_fragmentation_size_bytes{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}} / {{generation}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Allocation rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Bps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_allocations_size_bytes_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC committed memory",
      "description": "SUBSTITUTION (research F-2, RTD-02 amendment). This is GC-COMMITTED bytes, NOT the OS working set. No process_memory_working_set (nor any other OS-level memory) metric exists anywhere in this stack's Prometheus inventory. Obtaining one would require either adding the OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.Process package (a src/ change) or adding a cAdvisor/kubelet scrape job to the Prometheus config (a scrape-config change) — both are out of scope for this milestone, so this panel is titled for what it actually measures rather than for the axis it cannot measure. Caveat (research F-3): this gauge derives from GC.GetGCMemoryInfo() and is ABSENT for source=\"webapi\" until that pod performs its first GC, so an idle webapi legitimately shows no series here.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_gc_committed_memory_size_bytes{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Live object bytes",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_gc_objects_size_bytes{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC time per second",
      "description": "SUBSTITUTION (research F-2, RTD-02 amendment). Seconds of GC per second — a GC-PRESSURE proxy, not process CPU. This instrumentation (OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.Runtime 1.15.0 on net8.0) emits no process CPU metric at all, and none can be derived from what it does emit; a real one would need OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.Process (a src/ change) or a cAdvisor/kubelet scrape job (a scrape-config change), both out of scope. This panel is deliberately NOT titled CPU: an empty or mislabelled CPU panel is a defect under the RTD-02 amendment, and lint rule S12 enforces that.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_duration_nanoseconds_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval])) / 1e9",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Thread-pool threads",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "max by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_thread_pool_threads_count{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Thread-pool queue length",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "max by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_thread_pool_queue_length{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Thread-pool completion rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 32 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_thread_pool_completed_items_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Exception rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_exceptions_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lock contention rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 40 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_monitor_lock_contention_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Loaded assemblies",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 48 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "max by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_assemblies_count{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active timers",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 48 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "max by (source, service_instance_id) (process_runtime_dotnet_timer_count{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JIT methods compiled / sec",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 56 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (rate(process_runtime_dotnet_jit_methods_compiled_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pods reporting",
      "description": "SUBSTITUTION (research F-2, RTD-02 amendment). The honest substitute for a per-class availability readout: this counts the pods currently exporting runtime series, per selected service class. It is NOT process uptime — no process_start_time_seconds exists anywhere in this stack's inventory (see the 'Process restarts in range' panel for the restart proxy). A drop in this number against the expected replica count is the signal to read.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 56 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "count by (source) (process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\", generation=\"gen0\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Process restarts in range",
      "description": "SUBSTITUTION (research F-2, RTD-02 amendment). A counter-reset proxy standing in for process uptime, which this stack does not emit: there is no process_start_time_seconds anywhere in the inventory, so an actual uptime readout cannot be built from what the instrumentation provides. CAVEAT (research assumption A4): a counter reset can ALSO be produced by the OTel collector's metric_expiration (5 min default) rather than by a real process restart, so a nonzero value here is a restart SIGNAL, not a certified restart count. Whether a stable stack produces spurious nonzero values is recorded by the live run in plan 87-05.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 64 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (source, service_instance_id) (resets(process_runtime_dotnet_jit_methods_compiled_count_total{source=~\"$source\", service_instance_id=~\"$pod\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{service_instance_id}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
